
### 0. Dodanie wydatku

POST http://localhost:8001/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "b0d80956-5047-4150-b1b4-dddb978d6784",
  "payerId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "categoryId": "aaaaaaa5-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "amount": 120.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Paliwo",
  "expenseDate": "2025-05-15"
}

